      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it just feels like sometimes these people are just naturally disruptive, almost like they're working against the team on purpose. is there a way to identify if someone is just having a bad month vs. if they are actually just a problematic person at their core? i want to be able to spot that before it gets to the written warning stage if possible.",
